SUMMARY:A solution to 2-copy distillability of Werner states
DESCRIPTION:Entanglement distillation is a fundamental task in quantum information theory. In this work\, we prove that Werner states in arbitrary dimension are 2-copy distillable if and only if they are 1-copy distillable and hence answer the longstanding open question of the 2-copy distillability of Werner states. This is an important step on determining whether every non-positive partial transpose (NPT) sta\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/17350/
