SUMMARY:A Higher Differentiation and Van Est
DESCRIPTION:In this talk\, we will say how to obtain a higher differentiation using fat point as Severa's idea and how to further obtain Van Est using a suitable Eilenberg-Mac Lane space and path objects. The connection to the recent preprint of Carbera-de Hoyo will be given. Based on joint work with D. Li\, L. Ryvkin\, A. Wessel\, and the thesis of F. Dorsch.\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/17368/
