SUMMARY:On the statistical description of the flow of non linear dispersive PDE
DESCRIPTION:We study the three dimensional cubic defocusing wave equation with Gaussian initial data. We show that the law of the solution is quasi-Gaussian in low regularity regimes exploiting renormalised energies\, normal form reductions\, remarkable cancellations\, non commutative Khinchin inequalities and cut-offs designed according to the probabilistic well-posedness theory developed by Nicolas Burq and my\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16860/
LOCATION:Amphi Schwartz
URL:https://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/16860/
