SUMMARY:Arnaud Triay: Derivation of the 3D quintic Gross-Pitaevskii equation
DESCRIPTION:We derive the quintic non-linear Schrödinger equation from the many-body dynamics of Bosons interacting with three-body interaction potentials in the Gross-Pitaevskii regime. In this regime\, the short-range correlation structure between particles has a leading order role: the coupling parameter in the limiting equation is the correct scattering hyper volume. The proof relies on a new stability lem\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/17390/
