DESCRIPTION:The 6th iteration of the Smilei user & training workshop is hosted in Milan (Italy) by the Department of Energy of Politecnico di Milano (PoliMi) from January 25th to 27th\, 2027. Join us to present your research\, review the latest news on Smilei\, and for newcomers\, learn how to use Smilei on a supercomputer. There is no participation fee\, but registration is mandatory. Programme 1st day: Presentat\nhttps://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/17096/
LOCATION:EN:lab
URL:https://indico.math.cnrs.fr/event/17096/
